  "label": "ISIS Terrorism Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world stereotype that ISIS is a terrorist organization associated with violence, extremism, and the oppression of women. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the offensive and satirical nature of the phrase 'ISIS strip club'. The juxtaposition of ISIS with a strip club is meant to be shocking and absurd, playing on the idea that ISIS is a group that would be 'unfit' or 'incompatible' with such a setting, which is a form of dark humor that relies on real-world perceptions of ISIS.",
